# This repository publishes the DIGITAL MAP ONLY.
#
# The poster / image pipeline that renders the tabloid route posters and the
# Canva-ready map exports lives in this working directory and is used locally,
# but is deliberately not committed, so what GitHub Pages deploys stays a clean
# copy of the web map. Everything below is still fully usable on disk — git
# simply does not track it.

# Poster / print pipeline
poster/
posters/
style-poster.json
tools/render-poster.mjs
tools/export-map-image.mjs
tools/export-legend-svg.mjs

# Only referenced by the poster pipeline (the web map uses the woff2 files)
fonts/mulish-var.ttf

# Node
node_modules/
package.json
package-lock.json

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
